{"seq":4,"slug":"sqlite-embedded-db","title":"SQLite 与嵌入式数据库","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# SQLite 与嵌入式数据库 简介\n\nSQLite 是世界上部署最广泛的数据库引擎。它不需要独立的服务器进程，将整个数据库存储在单个磁盘文件中，却提供了完整的 ACID 事务支持和丰富的 SQL 功能。从智能手机到桌面应用，从嵌入式设备到边缘计算节点，SQLite 的身影无处不在。\n\n本知识库面向希望深入掌握 SQLite 及嵌入式数据库技术的开发者。无论你是正在构建 Electron 桌面应用、开发移动端离线存储方案，还是探索边缘计算场景下的数据管理策略，这里都将为你提供从原理到实践的完整知识体系。\n\n第一章**基础**从 SQLite 的架构设计出发，解析其单文件、无服务器的独特模型，深入理解动态类型系统与类型亲和性机制，掌握 Pragma 配置与 WAL 模式等关键调优手段，并明确 SQLite 与传统客户端/服务器数据库的适用边界。\n\n第二章**高级 SQL** 聚焦 SQLite 所支持的现代 SQL 特性，包括窗口函数、递归公共表表达式、JSON 操作函数以及 FTS5 全文搜索引擎，帮助你在嵌入式场景中发挥 SQL 的全部威力。\n\n第三章**性能**深入索引策略与查询计划分析，详解 WAL 模式下的读写并发机制，并提供内存管理与数据库调优的系统方法论。\n\n第四章**集成**围绕 Node.js 生态展开，涵盖 better-sqlite3 驱动的使用方式、数据库迁移的版本管理策略、主流 ORM 与查询构建器的 SQLite 适配，以及利用内存数据库进行高效测试的实践模式。\n\n第五章**部署**讨论生产环境中的备份恢复方案、基于 Litestream 和 LiteFS 的复制与分发技术、Electron 和 Tauri 等桌面应用中的嵌入模式，以及 D1 和 Turso 等 Serverless 平台上的 SQLite 应用。\n\n推荐学习路径为按章节顺序阅读。如果你已有 SQL 基础，可跳过第一章直接进入高级 SQL 部分；如果你主要关注工程实践，可以从第四章集成开始，再回头补充理论知识。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sqlite-architecture","title":"SQLite 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/sqlite-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-types-and-affinity","title":"数据类型与亲和性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/data-types-and-affinity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pragmas-and-configuration","title":"Pragma 与配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/pragmas-and-configuration"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sqlite-vs-client-server","title":"SQLite vs 客户端/服务器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/sqlite-vs-client-server"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"advanced-sql","title":"高级 SQL","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"window-functions","title":"窗口函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/window-functions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cte-and-recursive","title":"CTE 与递归查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/cte-and-recursive"},{"seq":3,"slug":"json-support","title":"JSON 支持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/json-support"},{"seq":4,"slug":"full-text-search","title":"全文搜索 FTS5","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/full-text-search"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance","title":"性能","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"indexing-strategies","title":"索引策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/indexing-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-planning","title":"查询计划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/query-planning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wal-and-concurrency","title":"WAL 与并发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/wal-and-concurrency"},{"seq":4,"slug":"memory-and-tuning","title":"内存与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/memory-and-tuning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"integration","title":"集成","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"better-sqlite3","title":"better-sqlite3 同步驱动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/integration/better-sqlite3"},{"seq":2,"slug":"migrations","title":"数据库迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/integration/migrations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"orm-and-query-builders","title":"ORM 与查询构建器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embed